
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research or the documented trigger offsets, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Kawasaki EX300 and EX400 Standalone ECU Integration and Trigger Offset Research"
authors:
  - family-names: "Toledo"
    given-names: "Guillermo"
    affiliation: "P.U.R.E. Formula SAE, Polytechnic University of Puerto Rico"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ydppr/Kawasaki-EX300-EX400-Standalone-ECU"
url: "https://github.com/ydppr/Kawasaki-EX300-EX400-Standalone-ECU"
abstract: >-
  Technical documentation of Kawasaki EX300 and EX400
  standalone ECU integration for Formula SAE applications.
  Includes the EX300 Alpha X custom ECU implementation,
  its reported timing-light-verified 130-degree TDC offset,
  and the preliminary 120-degree EX400 trigger offset
  calculation for the Haltech Elite 2000.
keywords:
  - Formula SAE
  - Kawasaki EX300
  - Kawasaki EX400
  - Alpha X ECU
  - Haltech Elite 2000
  - Crankshaft Trigger Offset
  - Engine Management
